  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.16.0 adds two bounded safe OSC 9 semantic operations: legacy desktop notification through SendNotificationAsync and explicitly secondary Windows Terminal/ConEmu current-directory compatibility through PublishWindowsCurrentDirectoryCompatibilityAsync. Both use strict UTF-8, reject C0/DEL/C1 controls, use ST framing, validate complete bounded payloads before commitment, serialize through the existing TerminalSession output domain, and never replay during lifecycle transitions. OSC 7 remains the preferred portable current-location API and retained OSC 9;4 progress remains byte-for-byte unchanged. Hazardous vendor commands for blocking UI, macro/process execution, environment disclosure, and emulator mutation remain deliberately inaccessible. The release includes real Icod.DCurses downstream acceptance and a fresh net8/net9/net10 NuGet-only package contract.",
